- **model**: The model of the network device (string)
- **vendor**: The vendor of the network device (string)
- **serial**: The serial number of the network device (string)
- **tags**: An array of tags associated with the network device (array of strings)
- **interfaces**: An object that represents the network interfaces of the device. Each interface is identified by a name (string) and has a type (string) and an IP address (string).
- **router_ips**: An array of IP addresses that the device can route traffic through (array of strings)

